  "adaptation": {
    "semantic": "\"tip\" covers a thin end, extra money for service, and useful advice. These are unrelated words in many languages.",
    "grammar": null,
    "culture": "Customs about money tips differ widely: in some places a tip is expected in restaurants and taxis, in others it is unusual or even refused.",
